# Trims the build context uploaded for `docker build "$bundle_dir"`.
# Dockerfile (multi-target muse|opencode) COPYs the vendored NodeSource key
# (keys/nodesource.asc), so both the parent dir and the file are allowlisted
# below. Both lines are required: a parent excluded by `**` cannot re-include
# its files, so `!keys/nodesource.asc` alone would stay excluded.
# (No COPY/ADD of generated harnesses or docs.)
**
!Dockerfile
!keys/
!keys/nodesource.asc
